{{!< default}}

{{!-- POST AS DISPATCHER. This template renders nothing itself:
it reads the post's internal collection tag out of post_class
and hands the whole post to the partial that owns that reading
experience. One tag decides the URL (routes.yaml), the layout
(here) and the queries that find the post — nothing else in the
theme knows the difference.

    #course      → post-course   (course landing)
    #module      → post-module   (training module landing)
    #training    → post-training (module reader)
    #lesson      → post-lesson   (course player)
    #video       → post-video    (the embed is the page)
    #slides      → post-slides   (the deck player)
    #newsletter  → post-issue    (issue + sent-date rail)
    #changelog   → post-simple   (narrow entry)
    #project     → post-project  (repo readme)
    anything else → post-blog    (the article)

Training MUST be checked before lesson: #lesson-type-video/-quiz/
-audio and #lesson-layout-* are facet tags shared with training
pages (post-training.hbs matches them too, for the video hero
variant), so their post_class always contains the literal
substring "tag-hash-lesson". A video-typed training post's classes
read "...tag-hash-training tag-hash-lesson-type-video..." — checking
#lesson first caught that substring and routed the whole page to
the course player, module rail and all, before #training was ever
reached. Checked this order, a real #lesson-col post never carries
a "training" tag, so nothing else changes. --}}

{{#post}}
    {{#match (post_class) "~" "tag-hash-course"}}
        {{> "post-course"}}
    {{else match (post_class) "~" "tag-hash-module"}}
        {{> "post-module"}}
    {{else match (post_class) "~" "tag-hash-training"}}
        {{> "post-training"}}
    {{else match (post_class) "~" "tag-hash-lesson"}}
        {{> "post-lesson"}}
    {{else match (post_class) "~" "tag-hash-video"}}
        {{> "post-video"}}
    {{else match (post_class) "~" "tag-hash-slides"}}
        {{> "post-slides"}}
    {{else match (post_class) "~" "tag-hash-newsletter"}}
        {{> "post-issue"}}
    {{else match (post_class) "~" "tag-hash-changelog"}}
        {{> "post-simple" sectionLabel="Changelog" sectionUrl="/changelog/" sectionIcon="history" withSidebar=true}}
    {{else match (post_class) "~" "tag-hash-resource"}}
        {{> "post-resource"}}
    {{else match (post_class) "~" "tag-hash-shop"}}
        {{> "post-product"}}
    {{else match (post_class) "~" "tag-hash-snippet"}}
        {{> "post-snippet"}}
    {{else match (post_class) "~" "tag-hash-prompt"}}
        {{> "post-prompt"}}
    {{else match (post_class) "~" "tag-hash-project"}}
        {{> "post-project"}}
    {{else}}
        {{> "post-blog"}}
    {{/match}}
{{/post}}
